ksystemstats (5.24.4-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Team upload.
  * Switch the transitional libsensors4-dev build dependency to
    libsensors4-dev. (Closes: #1008807)
  * Add the configuration for the CI on salsa.
  * debian/copyright: use spaces rather than tabs to start continuation lines.
  * Use secure URI in Homepage field.
  * Explicitly add the gettext, and pkg-config build dependencies.
  * Pass -DBUILD_TESTING=OFF to cmake to disable the build of tests, as they
    are not run at build time anyway.
  * Limit as linux-any the build dependencies used only on Linux:
    libkf5networkmanagerqt-dev, libnl-3-dev, libnl-route-3-dev, libsensors-dev,
    and libudev-dev.

 -- Pino Toscano <pino@debian.org>  Tue, 05 Apr 2022 20:24:19 +0200

